# The public suffix list this crate's table is built from: the file
# public_suffix_list.dat beside this one, byte for byte as the
# publicsuffix/list repository has it at PSL_COMMIT (committed there
# PSL_DATE), which is the list tldts 7.4.19 ships (rust/host/suffix.mjs
# compares the two rule by rule). build.rs refuses a file whose sha256 is
# not PSL_SHA256. Raise all three together with the tldts the lockfile
# pins: fetch
#   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/publicsuffix/list/<commit>/public_suffix_list.dat
# and ../tests/test_psl.txt from the same commit (the list's own test vectors),
# rebuild, run the harness.
PSL_COMMIT=52b71b3c4576ff77450cc7ebcfc7f34a916af3f9
PSL_DATE=2026-10-17
PSL_SHA256=3d92f70d719426d7e82dc4aee181058d0ad570d2559f0ea3ece8e731a25e5f33
